# The named hard-point cuts of the snapshot suite (plan 08-09, D-17, D-38). One line per cut: `<cut-id> <program> <pinned-tick> <family>`.
# The cut ids and their predicates over the instance after a unit are defined in docs/state/hard-points.md; the hidden-state checklist
# data/expected/state-checklist.ids names one of these ids as the witness of every STATE row, and the gate step state requires every cut here
# to be the witness of at least one row (token state-cut-unused) and every witness there to be a cut here (token state-witness-unknown).
# program: P-SDBD, P-HLT, P-FAULT, P-LATCH and P-PSG are the stand-in guests of docs/state/hard-points.md; lamp-idle and lamp-pass are the runs of
#   the scenarios demo-lamp-tone-idle and demo-lamp-tone-pass; diag-stic-2-collision is the scenario diag-stic2-collision-pass (controller word BD
#   at tick 0); none means that the cut is taken before any unit runs (HP-RESETPEND). The continuation of a none cut is the lamp-idle run.
# pinned-tick: the exact token pending-08-14 until plan 08-14 finds the first unit boundary where the predicate holds (a witness scan over the
#   step seam), writes the decimal machine tick here and re-proves it with a witness test. The ticks are self-recorded repeatability pins (found
#   by the scan of tests/state/state_witness.c, re-proved by the ids state.witness.*), never evidence of correctness.
# family: the test family that compares the cut: cpu-points (state.cut.cpu-points), stic-points (state.cut.stic-points) or device-points
#   (state.cut.device-points).
HP-SDBD P-SDBD 112 cpu-points
HP-STEAL-A lamp-idle 74932 cpu-points
HP-STEAL-B lamp-idle 78580 cpu-points
HP-STEAL-C lamp-idle 79016 cpu-points
HP-OPEN lamp-idle 59772 cpu-points
HP-CLOSED lamp-idle 59900 cpu-points
HP-INT-ENTRY lamp-idle 59808 cpu-points
HP-HLT P-HLT 372 cpu-points
HP-HALTED P-HLT 15168 cpu-points
HP-FAULTED P-FAULT 540 cpu-points
HP-RESETPEND none 0 cpu-points
HP-FRAME-MID lamp-idle pending-08-14 stic-points
HP-LATCH P-LATCH pending-08-14 stic-points
HP-MOB diag-stic-2-collision pending-08-14 stic-points
HP-PSG-MID P-PSG pending-08-14 device-points
HP-ENV-MID P-PSG pending-08-14 device-points
HP-INPUT lamp-pass pending-08-14 device-points
HP-LOG lamp-pass pending-08-14 device-points
